  "dcterms:title": "BioBricks Open Knowledge Graph (biobricks-okg)",
  "dcterms:description": "An integrated RDF/HDT open knowledge graph for BioBricks.ai, assembled with RML/Morph-KGC mappings over a set of upstream BioBricks source bricks. Its declared dependencies (.bb/dependencies.txt) are: bindingdb, chembl, ctdbase, hgnc, ice, mesh-kg, tox21, toxcast, toxrefdb and uniprot-kg. The repository's own MIT LICENSE covers the mapping/build code, not the aggregated third-party data. Because the graph combines these sources, its redistribution terms are governed by the most restrictive component -- notably CTD (ctdbase), which prohibits commercial use without a separate license, and ChEMBL, which is share-alike (CC BY-SA).",
